 ## `section.bin`
 
+### Version 86
+
+Compact lists, quotes, and preserved line breaks change pagination. Full and partial section caches rebuild. The CSS cache stores the whitespace mode in the existing property flags.
+
+### Version 85
+
+The section header stores two flags in the former Embedded Style byte. Bit 0 records whether publisher layout is enabled, and bit 1 records whether stylesheet rules can be used for emphasis. Full and partial section caches rebuild.
+
+### Version 84
+
+Expanded EPUB CSS selector matching can change the styles and layout of cached pages. Full and partial section caches rebuild.
+
 ### Version 83
 
 Nested paragraphs and other blocks retain inherited CSS bold and italic styles,
